[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6726.709, "timestamp": "01:52:06", "text": "呃，这个呃，你，是的。取这两个末端"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6734.95, "timestamp": "01:52:14", "text": "它。是的。是的，然后你就有权利了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6738.39, "timestamp": "01:52:18", "text": "将某个角向左倾斜，然后重复上述步骤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6744.87, "timestamp": "01:52:24", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6749.47, "timestamp": "01:52:29", "text": "像这样，把这两个放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6752.31, "timestamp": "01:52:32", "text": "向内制造"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6754.95, "timestamp": "01:52:34", "text": "再来一次，再来一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6759.35, "timestamp": "01:52:39", "text": "嗯，就像这样，我们对两边都做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6761.43, "timestamp": "01:52:41", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6764.589, "timestamp": "01:52:44", "text": "是的。所以你把两者都拿走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6766.109, "timestamp": "01:52:46", "text": "侧面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6770.47, "timestamp": "01:52:50", "text": "并将它们连接起来。两端和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6771.87, "timestamp": "01:52:51", "text": "连接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6775.27, "timestamp": "01:52:55", "text": "它。保持它们靠近。嗯，是的。得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6778.39, "timestamp": "01:52:58", "text": "中间那个。把你的手放在这里"}]